    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are a natural leader, and you founded your own <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Organization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Organization\">Organization</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You become the leader of an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Organization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Organization\">Organization</a> of your design. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Organization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Organization\">Organization</a> has a scale equal to one-half your Heroic Level plus your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> bonus and continues to grow in scale as you gain levels. You automatically begin with a +10 bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Organization_Score\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Organization Score\">Organization Score</a> for your new <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Organization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Organization\">Organization</a>.</p>",
